        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Manuel Orantes, Anna-Lena Grönefeld, Lucie Hradecká, Mariusz Fyrstenberg, Jean-Julien Rojer\n- Events: 1979 Romika Cup, 2014 French Open – Mixed Doubles\n- Roles: tennis players, champions\n\nFacts:\n- Manuel Orantes Corral was born on 6 February 1949 and is a former tennis player who was active in the 1970s and 1980s.\n- Anna-Lena Grönefeld was born on 4 June 1985 and is a German tennis player.\n- Manuel Orantes, the first seed, won the singles title at the 1979 Romika Cup.\n- At the 2014 French Open mixed doubles event, Lucie Hradecká and Mariusz Fyrstenberg lost in the second round to eventual champions Anna-Lena Grönefeld and Jean-Julien Rojer.",
